-regime/articleshow/127873878.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T06:56:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ephrat Livni</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873876,imgsize-34314.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sheikh Hasina, her UK lawmaker niece given 10-year jail in graft case]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873907.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sheikh-hasina-her-uk-lawmaker-niece-given-10-year-jail-in-graft-case/articleshow/127873907.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sheikh-hasina-her-uk-lawmaker-niece-given-10-year-jail-in-graft-case/articleshow/127873907.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T07:00:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ahsan Tasnim</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873893,imgsize-50060.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nick Fuentes shocked as Kick ends partnership just days after approval]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870903.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Online streamer Nicholas J. Fuentes saw his Kick partnership abruptly revoked just days after approval, sparking concerns over the platform's opaque policies. Despite boasting significant viewership, Fuentes received no explanation for the sudden termination. This incident highlights a pattern of inconsistent decisions on emerging platforms, leaving creators questioning transparency and fairness.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/nick-fuentes-shocked-as-kick-ends-partnership-just-days-after-approval/articleshow/127870903.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/nick-fuentes-shocked-as-kick-ends-partnership-just-days-after-approval/articleshow/127870903.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T02:48:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127870899,imgsize-810710.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Piers Morgan reacts strongly as Candace Owens podcast sparks outrage over Erika Kirk jokes and Charlie Kirk theories]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873387.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Piers Morgan condemned Candace Owens and Bassem Youssef after comments about Erika Kirk sparked backlash online. The remarks followed a podcast discussion that questioned her behavior during a leaked Zoom call. Morgan called the jokes cruel and unsupported by facts. He continues to challenge Owens to prove her claims or publicly retract them.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/piers-morgan-reacts-strongly-as-candace-owens-podcast-sparks-outrage-over-erika-kirk-jokes-and-charlie-kirk-theories/articleshow/127873387.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/piers-morgan-reacts-strongly-as-candace-owens-podcast-sparks-outrage-over-erika-kirk-jokes-and-charlie-kirk-theories/articleshow/127873387.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T05:05:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873382,imgsize-793585.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Khaby Lame net worth: Inside the $1 billion Rich Sparkle Holdings deal that raised billionaire rumors around TikTok star]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870847.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Khaby Lame’s nearly $1 billion deal is an all-stock agreement with Rich Sparkle Holdings, not a cash payout. The deal makes him a major shareholder and includes plans for an AI digital version of him. Despite online rumors, he has not retired and did not receive upfront cash.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/khaby-lame-net-worth-inside-the-1-billion-rich-sparkle-holdings-deal-that-raised-billionaire-rumors-around-tiktok-star/articleshow/127870847.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/khaby-lame-net-worth-inside-the-1-billion-rich-sparkle-holdings-deal-that-raised-billionaire-rumors-around-tiktok-star/articleshow/127870847.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T03:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127870908,imgsize-339974.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pro-Trump Brazilian influencer who said only ‘crooks’ get deported is detained by ICE]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873537.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-jnior-pena-pro-trump-brazilian-influencer-who-said-only-crooks-get-deported-is-detained-by-ice/articleshow/127873537.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-jnior-pena-pro-trump-brazilian-influencer-who-said-only-crooks-get-deported-is-detained-by-ice/articleshow/127873537.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T06:36:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873537,imgsize-563699.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida man uses iguanas as 'blankets' to tackle cold in bizarre viral video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873500.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-uses-iguanas-as-blankets-to-tackle-cold-in-bizarre-viral-video/articleshow/127873500.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-uses-iguanas-as-blankets-to-tackle-cold-in-bizarre-viral-video/articleshow/127873500.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T05:37:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873500,imgsize-1039903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Billie Eilish roasted after 'stolen land' remarks at Grammys: 'Return your $14 million LA mansion']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873095.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/billie-eilish-roasted-on-social-media-after-stolen-land-remarks-at-grammys-return-your-14-million-la-mansion/articleshow/127873095.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/billie-eilish-roasted-on-social-media-after-stolen-land-remarks-at-grammys-return-your-14-million-la-mansion/articleshow/127873095.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T04:51:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873095,imgsize-878227.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[At 90, Dalai Lama gets Grammy for audiobook ‘Meditations’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127873326.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Central Tibetan Administration (CTA), which is headquartered at McLeod Ganj in Dharamshala, said the award is a profound honour for Tibetan society. Although the Grammy spread cheer in this hill town, celebrations are on hold as the Dalai Lama is in Karnataka. American singer-songwriter Rufus Wainwright received the award on his behalf. ]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/at-90-dalai-lama-gets-grammy-for-audiobook-meditations/articleshow/127873326.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/at-90-dalai-lama-gets-grammy-for-audiobook-meditations/articleshow/127873326.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T04:44:27+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127873325,imgsize-58040.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Minneapolis school where ICE detained 5-year-old receives bomb threat]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870971.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/minneapolis-school-where-ice-detained-5-year-old-receives-bomb-threat/articleshow/127870971.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/minneapolis-school-where-ice-detained-5-year-old-receives-bomb-threat/articleshow/127870971.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T03:23:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127870971,imgsize-1062547.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump fumes over Trevor Noah’s Epstein Island joke at the Grammys: 'Sending my lawyers’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127862683.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-fumes-over-trevor-noahs-epstein-island-joke-at-the-grammys-sending-my-lawyers/articleshow/127862683.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-fumes-over-trevor-noahs-epstein-island-joke-at-the-grammys-sending-my-lawyers/articleshow/127862683.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-02T18:13:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127862683,imgsize-25924.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Stanford students pretend to be Jains to escape $7,944 mandatory meal plan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127872443.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Stanford student's essay alleging undergraduates falsely claim Jain identity to bypass mandatory meal plans has sparked debate. The claim, based on anecdotal evidence, suggests students exploit religious exemptions to redirect dining funds. This controversy highlights broader student frustration with expensive, inflexible campus dining and the challenges universities face in balancing accommodations with potential misuse.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stanford-students-pretend-to-be-jains-to-escape-7944-mandatory-meal-plan/articleshow/127872443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/stanford-students-pretend-to-be-jains-to-escape-7944-mandatory-meal-plan/articleshow/127872443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T04:12:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127872934,imgsize-1007980.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jeffrey Epstein has a ‘secret son’? Explosive DOJ emails show he was congratulated for ‘baby boy’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870796.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Newly released DOJ documents reveal an email from Sarah Ferguson seemingly congratulating Jeffrey Epstein on a “baby boy,” suggesting he may have had a secret child, though this remains unverified. The files also show Ferguson’s frustration over Epst'ein using her to access Prince Andrew, reveal Andrew’s continued contact with Epstein until 2017, and highlight Epstein’s extensive high-level connections. Allegations remain unproven.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jeffrey-epstein-has-a-secret-son-explosive-doj-emails-show-he-was-congratulated-for-baby-boy/articleshow/127870796.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jeffrey-epstein-has-a-secret-son-explosive-doj-emails-show-he-was-congratulated-for-baby-boy/articleshow/127870796.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T03:37:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127871276,imgsize-148880.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Nancy Guthrie? 84-year-old mother of NBC’s ‘Today’ show host Savannah Guthrie reported missing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870469.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-nancy-guthrie-84-year-old-mother-of-nbcs-today-show-host-savannah-guthrie-reported-missing/articleshow/127870469.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-nancy-guthrie-84-year-old-mother-of-nbcs-today-show-host-savannah-guthrie-reported-missing/articleshow/127870469.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T02:39:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127870469,imgsize-911519.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hasan Piker back on Twitch as platform shortens suspension to three days]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Hasan Piker, also known as HasanAbi, has returned to Twitch after a three-day suspension, reduced from seven days following an appeal. While Twitch hasn't officially confirmed the reason, reports suggest it stemmed from his use of the phrase "Zionist-pigs." During his ban, Piker continued streaming on YouTube, attracting significant viewership and donations for immigration advocacy groups.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasan-piker-back-on-twitch-as-platform-shortens-suspension-to-three-days/articleshow/127870730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasan-piker-back-on-twitch-as-platform-shortens-suspension-to-three-days/articleshow/127870730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T01:47:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127870727,imgsize-708538.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Norway Crown Princess says she regrets connection with Epstein whom she called 'sweetheart' in email: I showed poor judgement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127870701.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://